  "body": "So for this property, https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-doc/blob/03641d9e48c3e3e73ff8b3c851e2338fb8ceea87/api/client-server/keys.yaml#L75-L80\r\n\r\nOne of the examples are,\r\nhttps://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-doc/blob/03641d9e48c3e3e73ff8b3c851e2338fb8ceea87/api/client-server/keys.yaml#L86-L90\r\n\r\nThe schema and example doesn't match so one of them is wrong. (The doc seems to insist the example is wrong).\r\n\r\n\r\nTL;DR\r\nThe schema says, `Map<String, String>` but the example is `Map<String, Map<String, String>>`.\r\n",
